  "description": "Fuaran.Modelling — the spec-agnostic model manager: the decision record over statistical / econometric model specs. A branching exploration op-DAG (fork, return-to-ancestor, cherry-pick, curate) with deterministic path replay, curation records, self-contained outcome snapshots keyed by a composite join key, party-scoped assent with derived consensus and a tension surface over the two quality axes, and a default-deny policy layer over the op vocabulary, fit submission and each declared party class. The spec payload is opaque throughout — no estimator, no model vocabulary, no framework. Composition over Fuaran.Core; FSharp.Core only.",
